    {
      "id": "8c8b896f",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Ответ zero, повтор 3\n\n[\n  {\n    \"subject\": \"glowing mechanical robotic arm with intricate metal joints\",\n    \"setting\": \"dark abstract background for a robotics festival poster\",\n    \"style\": \"3D render\",\n    \"lighting\": \"glowing neon rim light\",\n    \"palette\": [\"blue\", \"amber\"],\n    \"composition\": \"centered\",\n    \"avoid\": [\"people\", \"text\"]\n  },\n  {\n    \"subject\": \"industrial robotic manipulator arms competing on a platform\",\n    \"setting\": \"clean minimal industrial arena\",\n    \"style\": \"minimal geometric\",\n    \"lighting\": \"cold neutral white light\",\n    \"palette\": [\"gray\", \"white\", \"black\"],\n    \"composition\": \"wide negative space\",\n    \"avoid\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"subject\": \"friendly small cute robot with rounded shapes\",\n    \"setting\": \"on a wooden school desk in a classroom\",\n    \"style\": \"flat vector illustration\",\n    \"lighting\": \"warm desk lamp glow\",\n    \"palette\": [\"amber\", \"orange\", \"yellow\"],\n    \"composition\": \"centered\",\n    \"avoid\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"subject\": \"robotic manipulator arm grasping a glowing sphere\",\n    \"setting\": \"pure black void background\",\n    \"style\": \"3D render\",\n    \"lighting\": \"electric blue glow from sphere\",\n    \"palette\": [\"black\", \"blue\"],\n    \"composition\": \"close-up\",\n    \"avoid\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"subject\": \"rows of warehouse shelving racks and a robotic forklift\",\n    \"setting\": \"automated warehouse interior\",\n    \"style\": \"isometric 3D render\",\n    \"lighting\": \"soft even ambient light\",\n    \"palette\": [\"gray\", \"orange\"],\n    \"composition\": \"centered\",\n    \"avoid\": []\n  }\n]"
      ],
